---
// Quiz figure for Post 2: two award-card layouts that carry the same information in a different rank order.
---
<div class="qfig-uxq02cardranks">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 600 270" role="img" aria-label="Two award cards with the same four pieces of information. Left, the 2017 card: a logo at the top, the winner name and the producers in the middle at the same size and weight, and the category at the bottom in small print. Right, the redesign: the category in large type at the top, the winner and producers in the middle, and a small statuette at the bottom.">
    <rect x="8" y="8" width="276" height="220" rx="8" class="card" />
    <circle cx="146" cy="40" r="16" class="logo" />
    <text x="146" y="45" text-anchor="middle" class="tiny"><tspan data-lang-en>Logo</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Logo</tspan></text>
    <text x="146" y="102" text-anchor="middle" class="mid"><tspan data-lang-en>Winner name</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Tên người thắng</tspan></text>
    <text x="146" y="130" text-anchor="middle" class="mid"><tspan data-lang-en>Producers</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Nhà sản xuất</tspan></text>
    <text x="146" y="206" text-anchor="middle" class="cat"><tspan data-lang-en>Category</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Hạng mục</tspan></text>
    <text x="146" y="256" text-anchor="middle" class="lab"><tspan data-lang-en>2017 card</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Thẻ 2017</tspan></text>

    <rect x="316" y="8" width="276" height="220" rx="8" class="card" />
    <text x="454" y="64" text-anchor="middle" class="bigcat"><tspan data-lang-en>Category</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Hạng mục</tspan></text>
    <text x="454" y="124" text-anchor="middle" class="mid"><tspan data-lang-en>Winner name</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Tên người thắng</tspan></text>
    <text x="454" y="152" text-anchor="middle" class="mid"><tspan data-lang-en>Producers</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Nhà sản xuất</tspan></text>
    <rect x="446" y="188" width="16" height="28" rx="4" class="logo" />
    <text x="454" y="256" text-anchor="middle" class="lab"><tspan data-lang-en>Bannister's redesign</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Bản thiết kế lại của Bannister</tspan></text>
  </svg>
</div>

<style>
  .qfig-uxq02cardranks { margin: 0; width: 100%; }
  .qfig-uxq02cardranks svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 320px; height: auto; }
  .qfig-uxq02cardranks .card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .qfig-uxq02cardranks .logo { fill: var(--gold); stroke: none; }
  .qfig-uxq02cardranks .tiny { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--bg); }
  .qfig-uxq02cardranks .mid { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-uxq02cardranks .cat { font-size: 13px; font-style: italic; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .qfig-uxq02cardranks .bigcat { font-size: 34px; font-weight: 800; fill: var(--gold); }
  .qfig-uxq02cardranks .lab { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
</style>
